Subject: [PATCH 02445/11362] [conductor] Pre-gate block: PHASE A2 (HEADLINE
 skeptic-proofing; GATED on exp4359 s3_guided_beats_control==true) -- PAPO
 REWARD-STATE-ALIGNMENT DIAGNOSTIC (arXiv:2606.08501 VERIFIED 'Back on Track:
 Aligning Rewards and States for Reasoning in Diffusion LLMs'). IF exp4359
 shows a Prism-hardened generation gain, the operator (twice-burned on
 DiffusionGemma over-claims) will ask: is the gain from rewards aligned to
 AUTHENTIC denoising states, or an artifact of remasking / position cues / the
 scorer correlating with something other than process quality? PAPO is the
 diagnostic: evaluate the leak-robust scorer's partial-state predictions
 against AUTHENTIC recorded denoising trajectories vs RANDOMLY-REMASKED
 (artificial-context) states, and report the reward-state ALIGNMENT (does the
 reward track genuine intermediate process quality?). Emit
 reward_state_alignment_passed BARE bool := (the scorer's reward correlates
 with authentic-trajectory process quality SIGNIFICANTLY MORE than with
 randomly-remasked states, CI95-excl-0). verifier_is_oracle=false. A pass =
 the gain is genuine (headline graduates); a fail = the gain is
 alignment-confounded and is QUARANTINED (not headline-eligible) + the
 residual logged as a missing-verifier gap. NO training; NO TRM training;
 DiffusionGemma via the llama.cpp PR binary.

1 of 1 gate(s) failed; first failure: exp4359-prism-hardened-verifier-guided-search.s3_guided_beats_control (actual=False == expected=True)

